  "worked_solution": "The word \"and\" is represented by the symbol \"$\\land.$\"\n\nNote that the given sentence is a shortened version of the following full sentence:\n\n$4$ is even and $4$ is positive.\n\nSo, the sentence reads\n\n\\[\n\\underbrace{4 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{ is even} }_X \\quad \\underbrace{\\vphantom{p}\\textrm{and}}_{\\land} \\quad \\underbrace{4 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{  is positive}}_Y,\n\\]\n\nthat is, $X \\land Y.$",
