  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-170738\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>The word \"and\" is represented by the symbol \"$\\land.$\"</p>\n<p>Note that the given sentence is a shortened version of the following full sentence:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>$4$ is even and $4$ is positive.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>So, the sentence reads</p>\n<p>\\[\n\\underbrace{4 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{ is even} }_X \\quad \\underbrace{\\vphantom{p}\\textrm{and}}_{\\land} \\quad \\underbrace{4 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{  is positive}}_Y,\n\\]</p>\n<p>that is, $X \\land Y.$ </p>\n</div>",
